    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span><span class=\"time\">35 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip bad\">Hard</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Trees</span><span class=\"chip accent\">BFS / DFS</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Design</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/serialize-and-deserialize-binary-tree/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 297</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Serialize and Deserialize Binary Tree</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">One traversal is enough if you also write down every missing child. Level order (or preorder) with a \"#\" for each null records the exact shape: n values + (n + 1) holes. Read the tokens back in the same order to rebuild the tree. O(n) time and space both ways.</p>\n"
